    "title": "Former Eagles star’s ex now dating ex-Philly fan favorite: ‘Stuck on you big man’",
    "text": "SportsPublished: Mar. 26, 2026, 11:44 a.m.Susie Celek and Hollis Thomas appear to be dating. (AP Photo/Peter Joneleit)By Brian Linder | blinder@pennlive.comSusie Celek and Brent Celek have been split up for more than a decade.In fact, according to reports, the former Philadelphia Eagles tight end and his ex-wife divorced in 2015.But it looks like she stayed within the organization when it comes to dating because she appears to have just gone Instagram official with another former Eagles player, Hollis Thomas. Susie shared several videos and photos on her social media platform, including a couple of the two smooching, and wrote, “Life trends show I’m not big on commitment, but I’m stuck on you big man.”Fans and followers showed their love and support in the comments. “My man Tank!!!!” one person replied. “Best of luck guys this is awesome.”“Hollis Thomas is a good man!” another wrote. “Good looking couple!” another wrote. “Wishing you the best.”“Good for you, brother,” another wrote. “Everybody deserves happiness. I hope you’re both happy. Have a long relationship together.”Thomas, 52, played for the Eagles from 1996 through 2005. He also had stints with the Saints, Rams and Panthers before wrapping up his career in 2009. He finished his career with 518 tackles and 20 sacks. RECOMMENDEDThe former defensive tackle has worked in sports media recently on the radio and hosting a podcast.Brent Celek, 41, spent his entire playing career — 2007 through 2017 — with the Eagles and currently works for the team. He helped the team beat the New England Patriots, 41-33, in Super Bowl LII.The former fifth-round pick caught 398 passes for 4,998 yards and 31 touchdowns. Brian Linder is the trending editor at PennLive.com. He has more than 20 years of experience working for newspapers first in South Carolina, then Daytona Beach, Florida and now in Pennsylvania. Linder spent...",
